# Raw Figma exports: ~183MB of 4x PNG, and the archive rather than the build.
# `node tools/screens.mjs` converts them into public/img/work/<slug>/screens/
# as ~5MB of WebP, and that conversion is what ships and what is committed.
# Git keeps every blob forever, so these must never be committed even once.
# Re-export from Figma into these folders and re-run the script.
*Mobile & Web Screens/
*Mobile Screens/
*Web screens/
*Mobile and Web Screens/
